e yêu thích và lên đường đi!\n\n\nTính năng trò chơi:\n- Chế độ vô tận trên đường cao tốc\n- Thiết lập điều khiển ở tốc độ 75 km/h\n- 27 chiếc xe để chọn như xe đua, xe cảnh sát hoặc thậm chí xe tăng\n- Cứ mỗi 6 tiếng vào trận và được thưởng đặc biệt."}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/header.jpg?t=1741201411"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741201411"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_379ca1a142bfab83e1515c0350e9cca0ec915b22.600x338.jpg?t=1741201411","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_379ca1a142bfab83e1515c0350e9cca0ec915b22.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741201411"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_25207fe8e5b5dd95334bf272d629a065501246b4.600x338.jpg?t=1741201411","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_25207fe8e5b5dd95334bf272d629a065501246b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741201411"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_f9f2985d969302216496c57a1e5fc773382115b8.600x338.jpg?t=1741201411","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_f9f2985d969302216496c57a1e5fc773382115b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741201411"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_4200c67ef56cd6414a5b3200fc78c160b4a4e085.600x338.jpg?t=1741201411","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_4200c67ef56cd6414a5b3200fc78c160b4a4e085.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741201411"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1927710/ss_6ca51196b51f16d8dad3a348c0105cc96df3b676.600x338.jpg?